  "summary": "The architectural center is an immutable Diagram revision model composed into versioned canvases. Browser editing, agent tools, isolated change proposals, and evaluation workflows converge on shared canvas commands and history, while filesystem adapters publish durable records. Fifteen anchors capture these responsibilities, their ownership boundaries, and the separate static-analysis tooling. Review depth varied: every inventoried file received a source-text structural skim, with implementation-level tracing concentrated on these anchors.",
